  "description": "HUYDOV crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C48 H61 Dy4 N7 O23 2+,2(Cl1 O4 1-),C5 H5 N1,4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.720-3.857 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.63-110.10°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(μ3-OH)4(isonicotinate)6(py)(CH3OH)7](ClO4)2·py·4CH3OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
